From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] scripts/symlink-install-tree: Windows without symlink privilege

Without Developer Mode (or administrator rights) Windows refuses symlinks and
configure failed. Warn and go on: run the build tree's QEMU with
-L pc-bios -L build/pc-bios (scripts/run-pvg-vm.ps1 does).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 scripts/symlink-install-tree.py |    5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/scripts/symlink-install-tree.py b/scripts/symlink-install-tree.py
index b725638..3141cf3 100644
--- a/scripts/symlink-install-tree.py
+++ b/scripts/symlink-install-tree.py
@@ -29,6 +29,11 @@ def destdir_join(d1: str, d2: str) -> str:
         os.symlink(source, bundle_dest)
     except BaseException as e:
         if not isinstance(e, OSError) or e.errno != errno.EEXIST:
+            if os.name == 'nt' and isinstance(e, OSError):
+                # no symlink privilege: run the build with -L pc-bios -L build/pc-bios instead
+                print(f'warning: no qemu-bundle link for {dest} (Developer Mode is off)',
+                      file=sys.stderr)
+                continue
             if os.name == 'nt':
                 print('Please enable Developer Mode to support soft link '
                       'without Administrator permission')
-- 
